{"id":"n29614-1-3","stage":0,"title":"여섯 · 六","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29614-1-3-1","ko":"얘야. 새해가 됐는데 올해 몇 살이니?","zh":"孩子，新年到了，你今年几岁呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"얘야.","meaning":"“이 아이(这孩子)”的缩略语。","explanation":"얘：“이 아이(这孩子)”的缩略语。；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"얘","audio":"/audio/1ad358ceb1fa5d832807.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67258","senseId":"1","lemma":"얘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"새해가","meaning":"新年","explanation":"새해：新年；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"새해","audio":"/audio/9131dc433c64dfce6c01.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67897","senseId":"1","lemma":"새해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"됐는데","meaning":"到","explanation":"되다：到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"3","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"올해","meaning":"今年","explanation":"올해：今年","readings":[{"term":"올해","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67842","senseId":"1","lemma":"올해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몇","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살이니?","meaning":"岁","explanation":"살：岁；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67887","senseId":"1","lemma":"살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1ad358ceb1fa5d83","term":"얘","zh":"“이 아이(这孩子)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/1ad358ceb1fa5d832807.mp3","entryId":"67258","definition":"“이 아이(这孩子)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"9131dc433c64dfce","term":"새해","zh":"新年","audio":"/audio/9131dc433c64dfce6c01.mp3","entryId":"67897","definition":"新开始的一年。","pronunciation":["새해"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"到","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"到达某个时间、时期或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"8a0cd9bb73fb17e9","term":"올해","zh":"今年","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3","entryId":"67842","definition":"现在正在度过的这一年。","pronunciation":["올해"]},{"id":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几，多少","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3","entryId":"66235","definition":"用于询问不知道的数目。","pronunciation":["멷"]},{"id":"d804a5a98c800c56","term":"살","zh":"岁","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3","entryId":"67887","definition":"计算年龄的数量单位。","pronunciation":["살"]}],"audio":"/audio/1d1024b735dda3d50d0d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n29614-1-3-2","ko":"올해 여섯이에요.","zh":"我今年六岁。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"올해","meaning":"今年","explanation":"올해：今年","readings":[{"term":"올해","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67842","senseId":"1","lemma":"올해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여섯이에요.","meaning":"六","explanation":"여섯：六；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"여섯","audio":"/audio/e3da184cbf43240adbd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29614","senseId":"1","lemma":"여섯","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8a0cd9bb73fb17e9","term":"올해","zh":"今年","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3","entryId":"67842","definition":"现在正在度过的这一年。","pronunciation":["올해"]},{"id":"e3da184cbf43240a","term":"여섯","zh":"六","audio":"/audio/e3da184cbf43240adbd9.mp3","entryId":"29614","definition":"五加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["여섣"]}],"audio":"/audio/25b391cc686be51271bb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.3,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=29614","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":17,"sequenceScore":0.8135,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"option